// Garden of Tranquillity — Bernald first Talk-to. No vine op. No 988 write.
// CANDIDATE last-resort 2007-base (OSRS Talking to Bernald minus Charm /
// stronger-cure / Alain / RS3 Taverley). Hunt 289? no.
// Cite garden-bernald-talk-product-377.md.

[opnpc1,bernald]
if (%garden_quest < 1) {
    ~displaymessage(^dm_default);
    return;
}
~chatnpc("<p,quiz>Do you know anything about grapevine diseases?");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>I might - what's the problem?");
~chatnpc("<p,sad>You see those grapevines over there?");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>Yes. They don't look too happy at the moment.");
~chatnpc("<p,sad>They've come down with some strange disease that I've never encountered before. I've tried everything with them, but nothing seems to work. If it carries on like this I will lose all this year's crops.");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>I could probably help you with that, but I'd need something in return.");
~chatnpc("<p,happy>Anything, you just need to ask!");
~chatplayer("<p,quiz>Well, I'd like a supply of Burthorpe Vine seeds.");
~chatnpc("<p,sad>I'm afraid I can't do that.");
~chatplayer("<p,angry>I thought you said anything!");
~chatnpc("<p,sad>I'm afraid that is the one thing I cannot give you. Burthorpe Vine has been bred over many years and many past generations of my family. I could never give away something so special.");
return;
